  "prefLabel": "Plc 907.01 Notification of Pending License Expiration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 907.01 Notification of Pending License Expiration. The licensing bureau shall notify each licensee of the pending expiration of the licensee’s license in accordance with Plc 308.03.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
